I'm trying to follow the rules of [[Semantic Versioning|https://semver.org/]].

!! 1.0.0

* A label retraction (`neg`) only cancels the label from the same source, so a self-label can no longer cancel a moderation service's label
* Expired labels no longer hide replies
* Expired threads are dropped from the in-memory cache
* The avatar link is skipped by screen readers and the tab order, since the name next to it links to the same profile
* Malformed dates, image lists and facets from the API no longer break rendering

!! 0.1.0

* First release
